abstract: "Educational research project constructing minimum-variance, maximum-Sharpe and risk-parity portfolios under realistic constraints, comparing sample and Ledoit-Wolf shrunk covariance, and evaluating out-of-sample performance with a strictly chronological walk-forward design including transaction costs."
